Package: riscos-firmware
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: non-free-firmware/kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-rolpkg
Description: Firmware for USB Wi-Fi and network adapters, for RISC OS on Linux
 The firmware files the riscos-kernel-* packages' USB drivers ask for:
 USB Wi-Fi adapters (Realtek, MediaTek and Ralink, Atheros and others)
 and USB network adapters that need one. From linux-firmware; each
 maker's licence is in /usr/lib/firmware/LICENSES, and WHENCE there says
 which file is whose.
